The `--signer-workflow` value is now matched against the whole certificate identity instead of as a leading substring. I haven't run any tests.

- **No `@` in the value:** the value must match the full workflow path, optionally followed by `@` and any ref. A longer workflow file name or a lookalike repository no longer passes.
- **Value contains `@`:** the identity must equal the value exactly. A longer ref name, or an extra `@`-separated suffix, is rejected.

The ref is compared exactly as given, so a short name like `@main` will not match a certificate that carries `@refs/heads/main`. I left it that way to keep the change small; say if you want the short forms accepted.

